{
  "id": "ISA.22",
  "number": "22",
  "bookId": "ISA",
  "reference": "Isaya 22",
  "verseCount": 25,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "22",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "ISA 22"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "22",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 22:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eki nikyo kigambo ekyabaasirwe aha Ruhanga rw'Okubonekerwa. Inywena mwagendeleraki kutemba aha nshwi z'enju? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.22.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.22.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 22:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekigo kyona nikigambira eiguru, kyayandakarara, nikyeshanda kundi! Abanyu abagwire omu ndashana babaire batalikurashana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.22.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.22.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 22:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abatwazi banyu bona bairukire babakwata batakarasire mwambi na gumoi. Abanyu mtuli bashangirwe hona bakwetwe. Balikaba babaire bahungiire harai, engaro bazibataireho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.22.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.22.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 22:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nikyo ngiliire nti, “Mundugeho, mundeke nchure muno, mutafa kubi kummaramara aha rw'okuferwa abange omu ndashana.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.22.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.22.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 22:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekiro kiliho orwo Omukama Ruhanga w'amahe alitwihyamu emikono tukabumbulikwa, bakatulibatilira, tukahiga eky'okukora kikabura, eboma omu Ruhanga rw'okubonekerwa",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.22.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.22.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22:5",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Rw'okubonekerwa",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Ahandi nirwetwa, Benihinomu.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " zikakumba, n'omu mabanga abantu bakashekura enduru.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.22.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.22.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 22:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.22.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.22.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 22:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba Elamu bahagatire ebilimba by'emyambi, baina amagali n'ab'efarasi, kandi aba Kiri bashohoza engabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.22.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.22.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 22:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Empanga zawe ezirungi muno, zijwire amagali, n'ab'efarasi betekatekire balebire omuli nyarulembo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.22.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.22.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 22:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amani ga Yuda gona gahwa. Kiro kilinya mukahiga ebikwato by'endashana omu Nju y'Ekibira, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.22.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.22.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 22:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kugya kubona mushanga ekigo kya Daudi bakitemire ebika bingi. Amaizi g'ekitunga kya bugyaifo mwagataha, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.22.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.22.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 22:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mwabara amaju ga Yerusalemu, mwamara mwagakambura kwihyamu amabare g'okushubisamu eboma kugigumisa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.22.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.22.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 22:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omugati ya eboma zombili mwalimamu eiziba ly'okubiikamu amaizi ag'ekitunga ekikuru. Kyonkai kandi Ruhanga ayayombekire ekigo ekyo timwamufaho, wenene ogwo ayakitekatekire kwema akarai kona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.22.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.22.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 22:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kir'ekyo Omukama Ruhanga w'amahe akaragira abantu kuchura bakakemaramu, kumoisa eishoke n'okwekoma engunia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.22.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.22.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 22:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi inywe mwashemelerwa gaba malili. Mwabaaga ente, mwaita entaama, mwalya enyama ezo, n'okunywa mwanywa, mukwese, “Katulye, katunywe, manya nyenkya tuli b'okufa.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.22.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.22.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 22:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukama w'amahe angambiire ati, “Mazima mulilemwa mwafa mutakagaruliirwe ntambara egi.” Nikwo alikuhanga Omukama Ruhanga w'amahe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.22.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.22.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 22:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.22.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.22.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 22:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukama Ruhanga w'amahe nagamba ati, “Ogende ow'omusigire olinya, Shebuna, omugelezi wa nyaruju, omugambire oti, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.22.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.22.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 22:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Munu nokoramuki? Hanu aha omwiru wawe n'ohai? Iwe osaine kwebaizira enyanga y'orwazi omw'ibanga? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.22.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.22.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 22:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nikwo, oli muntu w'enshonga kyonkai Omukama naija kukubaratura ahansi akakujugunya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.22.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.22.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 22:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nakubaratura nk'omupira akunage omu nsi eyeyanjaire, obe niyo ogwa n'amagali gawe agakutera eishaija gabe niyo gaikara, iwe orwo wagyaho okahemura nyaruju ya mukama wawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.22.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.22.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 22:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndakubinga aha mulimo obukuru bukurugeho, obe muntu ataina mugasho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.22.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.22.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 22:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kir'ekyo ndyeta omwiru wange Eliakimu eya Hilikia, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.22.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.22.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 22:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "enyambarwa eyawe mbe niyo mwambika, omuyondo gwawe mbe nigwo mukoma, n'obushobora obwo obaire oinabwo mbe n'iwe mbuha. Abantu ba Yerusalemu n'ab'enju ya Yuda tulimweta ishebo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.22.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.22.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 22:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Obukama bw'engoma ya Yuda nimbumuha; k'alikingura taliho alikinga, kandi k'alikinga taliho alikingura. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.22.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.22.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 22:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndimuteka ahagumire nka mtuli bateka ensindi, obukamabwe buliba ntabuko y'ekitinwa ky'eka ya ishe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.22.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.22.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 22:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kyonkai abanyabuzare ba wenene bona n'atuli b'okujunwa wenene tulimusikilira, tulimulerembaho okw'obon'ebikwato by'omu nju bilerembire aha mugamba kwema aha kikompe kugoba aha binika mpango. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.22.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.22.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 22:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukama w'amahe nagamba okwo kir'ekyo ensindi eliba esimbire ahagumire elirugaho, bagiteme egwe, n'obusikizi obulishangwa bugituraho bulihwaho; eki kigambirwe Omukama.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.22.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.22.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
